  "A1": "Every time a new sample is ready",
  "A2": "ECG ADC",
  "A3": "0x24",
  "A4": "Memory-mapped I/O",
  "B1": "The software was busy waiting — checking the printer's status in a loop",
  "B2": "It is nearer to the processor in the daisy chain, so it got the acknowledgement first",
  "B3": "The program counter (PC) and the processor status register (PS)",
  "B4": "During a burst the DMA keeps the bus, so the processor could not store new samples",
